00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:52,320
If you two can abandon me,
I can abandon you too!

550
00:39:52,400 --> 00:39:54,760
Tuang? Tuang...

551
00:39:58,280 --> 00:40:00,720
Tul, I'm sorry. Please don't go.

552
00:40:00,800 --> 00:40:02,600
- Please.
- Let go, Chris.

553
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:04,520
- I...
- Let go.

554
00:40:04,600 --> 00:40:05,680
Chris!

555
00:40:09,680 --> 00:40:10,760
Tul, please.

556
00:40:11,320 --> 00:40:12,320
Let me go.

557
00:40:18,200 --> 00:40:19,280
Tul!

558
00:40:35,160 --> 00:40:38,000
Hey, you can't just drive
into someone's house without permission.

559
00:40:38,080 --> 00:40:40,280
Even a foreigner like
me knows Thai customs.

560
00:41:03,400 --> 00:41:04,520
Tuang.

561
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:08,320
Can I talk to you?

562
00:41:09,120 --> 00:41:11,960
Just because I didn't go with Mom
doesn't mean I chose you.

563
00:41:12,040 --> 00:41:13,440
I'd leave if I could.

564
00:41:20,440 --> 00:41:21,720
I'm sorry.

565
00:41:23,880 --> 00:41:25,680
"I'm sorry. I'm so sorry."

566
00:41:25,760 --> 00:41:27,280
Is that all you can say?!

567
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:28,840
Can't you say anything else?

568
00:41:29,240 --> 00:41:32,120
You never have the guts
to make the right decision!

569
00:41:32,840 --> 00:41:36,480
But you had the guts to cheat on Mom?

570
00:41:36,560 --> 00:41:38,280
Why didn't You help me?

571
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:42,360
This is so fucking annoying.

572
00:41:43,240 --> 00:41:44,960
Why did You abandon me?

573
00:41:45,680 --> 00:41:47,560
If you can't bring Mom back,

574
00:41:48,600 --> 00:41:50,280
then you're just a coward.

575
00:41:55,320 --> 00:41:56,560
Where are You?

576
00:41:59,920 --> 00:42:02,200
Didn't You promise to give me peace?

577
00:42:04,600 --> 00:42:06,720
I've prayed to You hundreds of times.

578
00:42:07,200 --> 00:42:09,120
I've said "Amen" a thousand times!

579
00:42:09,200 --> 00:42:11,480
And this is what I get?

580
00:42:12,040 --> 00:42:14,920
This? This fucking misery?!

581
00:42:15,560 --> 00:42:18,120
Why is this happening to me?

582
00:42:37,880 --> 00:42:38,920
Nalin?

583
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:40,920
Come out and meet me.

584
00:42:52,000 --> 00:42:53,000
Chris?

585
00:42:54,360 --> 00:42:55,840
Stay away from me!

586
00:42:56,600 --> 00:42:58,640
I don't want to lose Tul or my son.

587
00:42:59,080 --> 00:43:00,480
I won't lose my way again.

588
00:43:01,320 --> 00:43:03,440
- But the two of us...
- Are you crazy?

589
00:43:03,920 --> 00:43:06,000
Damaging my reputation is one thing

590
00:43:06,080 --> 00:43:07,640
but you also secretly recorded us!

591
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:13,680
I just want you to guide me to God.

592
00:43:14,800 --> 00:43:16,400
Stop using God as an excuse!

593
00:43:16,480 --> 00:43:18,920
God is about to forsake me.

594
00:43:20,960 --> 00:43:22,560
But I'm lost.

595
00:43:23,000 --> 00:43:25,640
I want you to guide me onto the right path.

596
00:43:26,360 --> 00:43:27,880
Please, Chris.

597
00:43:30,160 --> 00:43:31,320
Listen to me.

598
00:43:32,440 --> 00:43:35,560
Right now,
you're leading me down the wrong path.

599
00:43:36,320 --> 00:43:37,480
Chris...

600
00:43:37,960 --> 00:43:39,160
Chris?

601
00:43:39,240 --> 00:43:41,840
Stop lying and leave me alone!

602
00:43:42,480 --> 00:43:43,520
Chris...

603
00:43:50,880 --> 00:43:51,880
Chris...

604
00:43:52,560 --> 00:43:53,560
Chris...

605
00:43:55,440 --> 00:43:59,480
CHRIS

606
00:44:05,920 --> 00:44:07,040
Yes?

607
00:44:09,080 --> 00:44:10,200
What?

608
00:44:14,080 --> 00:44:16,160
Stay put. I'll be right there.

609
00:44:52,840 --> 00:44:54,400
NEXT EPISODE

610
00:44:54,680 --> 00:44:55,960
I didn't kill that woman.

611
00:44:56,040 --> 00:44:57,320
Then what happened?

612
00:44:57,840 --> 00:44:58,840
Chris...

613
00:45:00,280 --> 00:45:01,400
Did you really kill Nalin?

614
00:45:02,240 --> 00:45:04,120
Don't confess to anything.

615
00:45:05,480 --> 00:45:07,800
♪Then where were you
on the day of the incident?

616
00:45:08,360 --> 00:45:11,240
Your statements contradict each other.

617
00:45:11,320 --> 00:45:12,680
Are you challenging me?

618
00:45:12,760 --> 00:45:13,840
The autopsy results?

619
00:45:13,920 --> 00:45:15,720
Just brace yourself, okay?
